{"version":1,"key":"card:584","content":{"id":584,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 的优势及特点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"节省存储空间"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在一台电脑上有 100 个 npm 项目，每个项目中存在相同的依赖，那么这些依赖在每个项目中都会存在一份。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 有一个中心化的 content-addressed store 来解决这个问题，所有的依赖都会安装到这里，在两个方面做了优化来节省磁盘空间："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于相同依赖的不同版本，只会存储发生变化的版本，比如两个版本间只存在一个文件的变化，那么安装新版本时，只会添加一个变化的文件，而不是下载整个新的包"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有的数据仅保存在中心化的 content-addressed store 中，项目中的包通过硬链接技术链接到 store 中的文件，不管有多少个项目，相同的依赖仅存在一份，做到了项目间的依赖共享"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装速度"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e24d44e1-6bec-4c9b-976a-d8cdc79d2aa6.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e24d44e1-6bec-4c9b-976a-d8cdc79d2aa6.png","width":714},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 的安装分为三个阶段："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"依赖解析"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"node_modules 目录结构计算"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"链接依赖"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_49ef845f-921f-42a2-8eb0-fe97c4b54aaf.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_49ef845f-921f-42a2-8eb0-fe97c4b54aaf.png","width":714},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比于传统的三阶段：解析依赖、安装依赖、将所有依赖写入到 node_modules 中要快很多"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3d95be92-d327-4fb3-bb98-4d79a59f85a7.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3d95be92-d327-4fb3-bb98-4d79a59f85a7.png","width":714}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"幽灵依赖"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之前为了解决安装路径过长的问题，npm 会将依赖平铺安装在 node_modules 下面，但是这会带来幽灵依赖的问题，即可以使用未在 package.json 中声明的包。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 会把所有的依赖都平铺安装到 node_modules/.pnpm 下面，package.json 中显式声明的依赖会通过软链提升到 node_modules 下面，由于只有 package.json 中显式声明的依赖直接放到了 node_modules 下面，因此解决了幽灵依赖问题，同时因为依赖平铺安装在 .pnpm 目录下，因此也解决了路径过长的问题。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.pnpm.cn/benchmarks","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Benchmarks of JavaScript Package Managers"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.cnblogs.com/feixianxing/p/18359597/node-package-manager-compare-pnpm-vs-npm-and-yarn","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 与 npm/yarn 的对比"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://pnpm.io/motivation","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Motivation"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["面试题","包管理器/pnpm"],"createTime":1745400164578,"updateTime":1762691704830,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762691704830}}